verses.commentary:
2:9 Assyria had been a cruel and despotic nation for many years. She confiscated all her conquered people's
idols and treasure. Her vaults were full.

What Assyria did to others is now done to them (cf. Job 34:11; Ps. 28:4; 62:12; Pro. 24:12; Eccl. 12:14;
Jer. 17:10; 32:19; Matt. 16:27; Rom. 2:6; 14:12; 1 Cor. 3:8; 2 Cor. 5:10; Gal. 6:7-10; 2 Tim. 4:14; 1 Pet. 1:17; Rev. 2:23;
20:12; 22:12). Note the double use of "plunders" both of which are Qal IMPERATIVES (BDB 102,
KB 117). This is YHWH's call to the invaders!
